{"product_id":"an-april-shroud-a-clubbable-woman","title":"An April Shroud: A Clubbable Woman","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn April shroud: Inspector Pascoe may take holidays but death never does - and neither, it seems, does Dalziel. A watery accident on a solo trip leads to the Superintendent drying off in Lake House, a rundown mansion. Its owner, the fulsome Mrs Fielding, has only just buried her husband, but seems more concerned with her future. A clubbable woman: Home from the Rugby Club after taking a nasty knock in a match, Sam Connon finds his wife even more uncommunicative than usual. After passing out on his bed for five hours, he come downstairs to discover communication has been cut off forever by a hole in the middle of her forehead.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 180\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Reginald Hill\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780007834846\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 313\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45754974666905,"sku":"16RC-3-9780007834846","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81loSVFkPFL._UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1759146952","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/an-april-shroud-a-clubbable-woman","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}